# SAVE ,A's FDC reads/writes on the SAVE line after D-ASAVEFAT (2026-11-12): time, command,
# BC (B = track-ish / C = sector), DE (track / side), HL (buffer). Data writes go to consecutive
# sectors but ~0.48 s apart: the PRODUCER, not the disk, sets the pace.
